  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nature Based Solutions for Urban Adaptation (NATURA) in Lao PDR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MFAT is interested to work with GGGI in Lao DPR. Fore the background to this, please refer to BTOR attached and on CRM.Based on initial discussion with MFAT, GGGI Laos is preparing a few ideas for MFAT to consider. These are super early stage ideas which can serve as a basis of discussion. Depending on the initial feedback we get from MFAT, we would aim to select one idea to build out into a proper concept. As such, at this point, the sectors/focus/SO areas of possible ideas are quite open. The note attached outlines our initial ideas, based on early indications from MFAT as to priorities from their side. Numbers on project size, timeline, etc are placeholders at this point - we haven&apos;t got to that level of discussion.</narrative>
  </description>
